OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed for killing highways
OL,4,Aworker in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA van driver who caused the death of a
OL,7,Fhighways worker on the M23 has been
OL,8,Fjailed for 10 years.
OL,10,FVilius Domarkas, 38, had admitted the
OL,11,Fcharge of causing death by dangerous
OL,12,Fdriving after he hit Anthony Howe, from
OL,13,FKent, while he was working on foot in a
OL,14,Fconed-off section of the motorway near
OL,15,FCrawley, West Sussex.
OL,17,FAt Lewes Crown Court, Judge Martin
OL,18,FHuseyin said the driver of the Citroen
OL,19,FRelay van had been "zig zagging between
OL,20,Flanes" before the collision at about
OL,21,F01:00 BST on 8 July, and was driving
OL,22,Fwhile under the influence of alcohol.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
