OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed for killing highways
OL,4,Aworker in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a victim statement, Mr Howe's
OL,7,Fpartner Lillian Bonney said her "entire
OL,8,Fworld was ripped apart" when he was
OL,9,Fkilled.
